<view class="page"><view class="intro"><text class="eyebrow">OPEN FEEDBACK</text><text class="title">反馈与建议</text><text class="copy">公开查看状态、管理员回复和已解决奖励。建议安全检查后匿名展示，不开放评论或投票。</text></view><view class="form"><text class="form-title">留下一条建议</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{categoryOptions}}" bindchange="onCategory"><view class="picker">建议分类：{{categoryOptions[category === 'product' ? 0 : category === 'campus' ? 1 : category === 'accessibility' ? 2 : 3]}}</view></picker><input maxlength="100" placeholder="标题：一句话概括你的想法" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle"/><textarea maxlength="3000" placeholder="描述遇到的情况，以及你希望看到的改进…" value="{{body}}" bindinput="onBody"/><text class="privacy">提交人对外显示为“匿名同学”；管理员可通过站内方式联系。联系方式和私人信息不要写入公开内容。</text><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">提交建议</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice success">{{notice}}</view><view class="section-heading"><text>公开进度</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{statusOptions}}" bindchange="onStatus"><view class="filter">{{selectedStatus}}⌄</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在读取公开建议…</view><view wx:elif="{{!items.length}}" class="state">暂无公开建议</view><view wx:else class="list"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="item"><view class="meta"><text>{{item.categoryLabel}}</text><text class="status">{{item.statusLabel}}</text><text>匿名同学</text></view><text class="item-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="item-body">{{item.body}}</text><view wx:if="{{item.reward_issued}}" class="reward">已解决 · 管理员设置奖励 {{item.reward_beans || 0}} 个贡献豆</view><view wx:if="{{item.public_reply}}" class="reply"><text class="reply-title">管理员回复</text><text>{{item.public_reply}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.status === 'not_adopted' && item.public_reason}}" class="reply"><text class="reply-title">暂不采纳说明</text><text>{{item.public_reason}}</text></view></view></view></view>
